  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, whisk together hoisin sauce, coconut milk, fish sauce, lime juice, grated ginger, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the chicken thighs to the bowl and marinate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Preheat a large skillet or wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Remove the chicken from the marinade and cook until browned and cooked through.",
    "Add the cooked rice to the skillet or wok and stir to combine with the chicken and marinade.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in chopped Thai basil leaves.",
    "Serve the kao mun gai hot, garnished with additional basil leaves if desired."
